    "title": "Jasper Co. leaders outline growth plans with local businesses - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Aaron Dixon ,\n8 hours ago HARDEEVILLE, S.C. (WTOC) - Jasper County leaders are trying to make sure they have all of their plans in place as the county continues to grow. They met with local businesses on Wednesday to talk about those plans at the annual “State of the County Breakfast” hosted by the Jasper County Chamber of Commerce. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
